3. Working-hour tracking.
4. Start and end time selection.
5. Duration or time-spent calculations.
6. Expected daily working hours.
7. Ticket creation.
8. Ticket editing and management.
9. Ticket assignment.
10. Ticket boards.
11. Azure DevOps API integration.
12. Automatic ticket synchronization.
