16. Unnecessary dashboards and charts.
17. Features that duplicate existing Azure DevOps functionality.

# 23. FINAL PRODUCT SUCCESS CRITERIA

WorkLedger is successful when it reliably answers these questions:

1. What work has the team completed?
2. What work is currently in progress?
3. What work has been recorded by each team member?
4. What work has been completed during the current sprint?
5. Has each member completed their daily work submission?
6. Can Admin generate a professional weekly team update with one click?
7. Can Admin configure what information members need to record without changing application code?

The application must provide accurate, consistent answers using actual saved data.

